Delay 5 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 1 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 43 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveTo 1333 159
Delay 5 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 1 ms
RightUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Dota 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>